PETSELFTEST1
# V4-03 environment life tips. "temp" steps stand in for the SHTC3 (status
# band + tip policy; the board publishes a reading every 10 s):
# The sensor may boot in any zone (the real board reads hot on USB), so
# the baseline holds 22 C for the whole 60 s first, so the log shows
# "zone=normal" before "mark begin" (if the sensor started normal
# there is simply no transition line there).
# 1) 33 C held for 60 s: "so hot" bubble (a glass of water) and the pet's
#    tip line (drink water); 2) back to 22 C: the room is normal again, no
#    tip; 3) 12 C held for 60 s: "so cold" bubble (a coat) and its line.
# Tips stay silent in the parent's quiet hours (PET_ENV_TIP_HELD): run this
# outside them. Gentle default temperament; ids per temperament are fixed,
# so the log names the context (ctx=hot_tip / cold_tip), not the id.
# Counted from "mark begin" (see tools/selftest_report.py).
# expect min:zone=hot 1
# expect min:kind=hot 1
# expect min:name=tip_hot 1
# expect min:ctx=hot_tip 1
# expect min:zone=normal 1
# expect min:zone=cold 1
# expect min:kind=cold 1
# expect min:name=tip_cold 1
# expect min:ctx=cold_tip 1
# expect min:temp_c=33 1
# expect min:temp_c=12 1
# expect none:PET_ENV_TIP_HELD 0
# expect none:PET_PHRASE_FAILED 0
# expect none:PET_SELFTEST_ABORT 0
# expect selftest_done 1
# expect timescale 25
# Quiet prompts while testing (RAM only, this boot).
volume 15
# TEST ONLY: the 60 s hold and the reaction delay at 25 %. "twait" scales
# with it; the animations, the status band and the audio stay real ("wait").
# Real speed: timescale 100 (selftest_report.py --timescale 100).
timescale 25
# Start as soon as XiaoZhi is idle (Wi-Fi up, activated), not after a
# fixed 20 s; the pet toggle below still retries.
waitidle 60000
pet
wait 6000
# Normalize restored pet state to "home, neutral".
tap press 6000
hold press 1500 6000
# Baseline: a comfortable room, held long enough (60 s, 15 s at 25 %) to
# leave whatever zone the real sensor started in.
temp 22
twait 70000
wait 3000
mark begin
# 1) Hot: the reading has to hold for 60 s (15 s at 25 %; the policy sees
#    the injected value at once, not at the next 10 s heartbeat).
temp 33
twait 70000
wait 9000
# 2) Back to comfortable (needs the same hold): no tip.
temp 22
twait 70000
wait 3000
# 3) Cold.
temp 12
twait 70000
wait 9000
# Hand the sensor back.
temp off
wait 2000
end
